{"title":"2010 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_@MathTalks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by @MathTalks</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Ryan got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/7/bb7e03ccc8985ba9d029ea4add6e3e15ab9a953a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of the problems correct on a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />-problem test, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/0/870303feff6f491471061a7402eba3e326ba84f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> on a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />-problem test, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/2/282fdef75f579c92565cd7e0734d83ccfd38bfdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> on a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />-problem test. What percent of all the problems did Ryan answer correctly? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f5b71e94fbe5051fdbf1a476320185987ad3ec1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 64 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 75\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 80\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 84\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 86$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Ryan answered <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/2/8c26ea8c47efd8e4ad49daa1ed1755f0a52d21d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0.8)(25)=20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" /> problems correct on the first test, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/7/6078108210ca7bcb4e860c2a1b5a34f3bf21208a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0.9)(40)=36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" /> on the second, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/0/ae070300a275da216a30dea546d947af6f9cd62d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0.7)(10)=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"105\" height=\"20\" /> on the third. This amounts to a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/7/f5735b2b8274930420db161c30e22e3e6ca4538e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20+36+7=63$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"131\" height=\"14\" /> problems correct. The total number of problems is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/6/d568b4c56d82580fbcc62d93726b6e8812d44688.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25+40+10=75.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"144\" height=\"14\" /> Therefore, the percentage is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/c/46c44847a986c18095d38a95fb4b18e5732d61c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{63}{75} = 84\\% \\rightarrow \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 84}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"174\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_.40MathTalks\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_@MathTalks\">Video Solution by @MathTalks</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by @MathTalks\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/RhyRqHMXvq0?si=m1R2q8UnLRD-KksT\">https://youtu.be/RhyRqHMXvq0?si=m1R2q8UnLRD-KksT</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\